  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<i>"Well, my time here is exactly how you’d expect. Go in, follow the instructions, hope I survive. Rinse and repeat. It’s halfway through December and I’m still alive. Here''s why: ‘cause you won’t take me down that easily! You think ya can kill me by tossing me in some bloody cell and throwing me to the wolves? You think I’m gonna sit down and take it? Newsflash, nerds. You’re gonna have to do a lot more than make me stare at a statue to get ridda me. I can do this all day! At this point, we might as well get to know each other. I might even spare ya if I see ya tryna ditch this joint like us. But one thing’s for sure…"'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
