      m_Calls: []
  m_text: “‘It speaks’, they said. I initially wrote it off as nonsense — a typical rumour that spreads about these types of mysterious objects. But now, I sense something. A presence. There is this feeling within myself when I get near it, both intriguing and baffling to me. I will continue to observe the Jailbird to gather more information, and maybe it will sate this itch I get when I am away from it.”
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
