  m_text: "SCP-049-2 can press E on any corpse they encounter that has not previously been consumed. After eating they will regenerate HP. The ability cannot be canceled once activated. It does not prevent SCP-049 reviving that player, and can only be done once per body. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
