      m_Calls: []
  m_text: “Another log. May as well keep some of my thoughts collected at least. Termination tests for 096 are going nowhere. Nobody can figure out how to snap, chip, or otherwise break its bone structure. Project Segmentum isn't getting any better, it's still locked up in its service locker. Techies are still trying to figure out some new method of delivering its energy supply. The only thing that does happen on the regular is 106’s containment breaches. Either I'm missing out on the fun stuff or our work here is entirely pointless.”
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
