  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "SCP-939 can pounce on its prey, ambushing and killing them. To initiate a lunge, SCP-939 must focus for a short duration. The ferocity of a lunge will kill any player it hits. Additionally, humans near the impact point will take considerable damage.\n\r\nSCP-939 takes several seconds to recover from a lunge. \r\n\r\n___\r\n\r<i>\n“The subject’s anomalous nature and method of reproduction does not distinguish it from other carnivores. The fact remains… It is the hunter and you are its prey.”\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
