  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The Surface Zone of the facility is the receiving area of the site as well as its outermost security level. According to security protocol Site-02-A991, all foundation and civilian satellites are to have a “blind spot” of the surrounding 10 km of land to maintain locational secrecy.  External site security is to administer amnestics to any human approaching the site, and to transfer them back outside this area.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
