      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The SCP Foundation’s internal security force deals with a large array of problems, such as old and poorly fabricated containment chambers, D-Class, and disloyalty. These brave men are the first and foremost response and can make all the difference. \r\n\r\nSecurity guards come equipped with all the tactical gear needed to handle any scenario, giving them the best chance of preventing a situation from escalating.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
