  m_text: A tactical 9mm pistol. High-capacity and lightweight; these were once the standard issue sidearm for Site-02’s on-site security. Though largely replaced by the FSP-9, some guards still covet the days when their firearm was a few pounds lighter.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
