    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\"I can still hear her screaming for help, you know. She didn't know, none of them did. God damn it, they weren't even supposed to be there! If it hadn't been for me she… she would have... she might still be alive but she's gone. It came out of the floor and took her. I wonder how long she looked for it… for a way out. A way that isn't there. \r\n\nSo yes doctor, I’m sure I want to take the damn amnestics.\"\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
