      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The fate of an inanimate object is not one any individual is likely to consider but one could feel just a twinge of sympathy for this hat. You see, as far as this hat’s fate goes, it is rather unfortunate. No one will ever see it adorning someone’s head and the wearer will be ignored by those around them. In every regard, if this hat held any sentience, its fate would be tragic.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
